  "description": "As a child, Seori is nearly sold into a courtesan house by her mother, but is saved by the benevolent Queen Yeonhwa. So she later helps the queen's son, Prince Seon-gyeom, avoid an attempt on his life and run away from the kingdom. Six years later, Seori is living in disguise as a \"male\" slave at the palace for her safety. But then, Seon-gyeom unexpectedly returns as a powerful prince and is drawn to Seori despite failing to recognize her. Can Seori keep her identity a secret with the prince's heated obsession growing by the day?\n\n**Original Novel:**    \nR19, R15\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19, R15\n\n**Official Translations:**    \nR19: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/palace-slave-m)   \nR15: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/palace-slave), [Japanese](https://mechacomic.jp/books/275241)",
